            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This report uses four cases to examine how agencies have used adaptive mangement and quantitative metrics to set minimum thresholds, measurable objectives and interim milestones to measure groundwater in California.  The report offers recommendations for Groundwater Sustainability Agencies as they write their sustainability plans.",
